<view class="hero"><view class="hi">自由豆</view><view class="sub2">官方补贴权益 · 与旅豆分开使用</view></view>
<view class="note">每单一份，不能与旅豆叠加；不可充值、转让、提现。不同满减规则的额度不能合并抵现。</view>
<view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{status === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="filter" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.name}}</view></view>
<view class="card state-error" wx:if="{{error}}"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
<view class="skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}" style="height:240rpx"></view>
<view class="card fade-up" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id">
  <view class="sec-title">{{item.name}}</view>
  <view class="fr-amount">满{{item.thresholdText}}减{{item.discountText}}</view>
  <view class="kv"><text>可用时间</text><text>{{item.from}} — {{item.to}}</text></view>
  <view class="kv"><text>适用范围</text><text>{{item.scopeText}}</text></view>
  <view class="note">官方发放 · {{item.reason}}</view>
  <button wx:if="{{item.orderNo}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="order" data-no="{{item.orderNo}}">查看使用订单 ›</button>
</view>
<view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!rows.length && !loading && !error}}"><view class="e-ico">🎁</view>暂无此类自由豆权益<view class="note">有新的官方补贴时会出现在这里</view></view>
<view class="chips fr-page"><button wx:if="{{page>1}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="prev">上一页</button><text class="muted">第{{page}}页 · 共{{total}}份</text><button wx:if="{{hasNext}}" class="btn ghost sm" bindtap="next">下一页</button></view>
